      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "democratic_party",
      "label": "Democratic Party",
      "description": "The Democratic Party is one of the two major political parties in the United States, historically associated with civil rights movements, racial justice advocacy, and opposition to slavery, segregation, and white supremacy. The meme's text falsely equates the party with the systems it has opposed, which requires understanding the party's historical role and ideological evolution to assess the meme's misleading nature.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_a738c4a5"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_419a3005",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "slavery",
      "label": "Slavery",
      "description": "Slavery is a historical system of forced labor and human exploitation that existed in the United States, particularly in the Southern states, before the Civil War. It is a foundational injustice that the Democratic Party, especially in its modern form, has historically opposed and sought to dismantle through legislation and civil rights movements.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
