      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme promotes a dangerous oversimplification of complex historical and political issues by falsely equating the Democratic Party with the systems of slavery, segregation, and white supremacy it has historically opposed. This can incite division, mislead the public, and be used to delegitimize a major political party, potentially justifying extremist views or actions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
